Damage photographs
------------------
The damage assessment feature is demonstrated against a corpus of vehicle
damage photographs. Those images are NOT included in this repository, and no
image is redistributed here.

scripts/load_claims.py downloads them at run time from the Hugging Face dataset
chittaranjankhatua/car_damage_pub, which states no licence. Because the terms
are unclear, treat anything derived from it as internal only, and do not
redistribute the images or any database loaded from them.

To run against your own photographs instead:

  uv run python scripts/load_claims.py --folder /path/to/your/images


